    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Little Fighters on Stream is a compilation of mini games in which you can play directly with the Twitch chat on your stream  using commands. It features a growing selection of  accion, skill and memorization mini-games in which you'll have to run, hit, throw and more with your Twitch chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The chat can play using commands that are specified in the lobby of each mini game, while the streamer executes the game and transmits it, showing to the chat with a little transmission delay, his situation within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589460/extras/ba668d69d71bff5a6ddae7f9d46fbddf.avif?t=1754692316\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mini-games, each of them with specific rules, rhythm and funny interactions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 very varied mini-games (soon a new game) for you to play with your stream chat (we're always adding new games)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fun design of characters, locations and environments.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items, in case you need more action and frenzy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Divi\u00e9rtete con tu comunidad de twitch!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Little Fighters on Stream is a game designed for interaction and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The minigames that we have finished are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Struggle</strong>: Is a wrestling game where players will fight a battle with the other participants. (Viewers vs Viewers)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Where it Gone?</strong>: Will test your memory and speed to remember tiles. (All vs All)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Juegardo</strong>: It is a competition where participants must throw the hoop. (Viewers vs IA)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explosive Paint</strong>: The streamer draws a secret word and the chat must guess it or everything will explode. (Viewers vs Streamer)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape: The Killer Swuid</strong>: The chat must reach the goal, however if you move in the red light, you will die. (Viewers vs IA)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Boats</strong>: The boat with the most people will be eliminated. (Viewers vs Viewers )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Penalties</strong>: Chat throw the ball and the streamer must catch it, FOOTBALL! (Viewers vs Streamer)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lucky Weel</strong>: It's a simple roulette to generate a winner. (Viewers vs IA)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crazy Cars</strong>: A crazy car race full of obstacles and curves in which the vehicles must reach the finish line.\u00a0(Viewers vs IA) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589460/extras/3456e98d6ab9685cc8592b9c47116c35.avif?t=1754692316\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/Delay.png</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589460/extras/a212e537d92e03f215b235ac298e8226.avif?t=1754692316\" /></div>All mini games are designed with transmission delay in mind. This won't be a problem because all the mini games have a comfortable response time. Try it and you'll see it.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Little Fighters on Stream is a compilation of mini games in which you can play directly with the Twitch chat on your stream  using commands. It features a growing selection of  accion, skill and memorization mini-games in which you'll have to run, hit, throw and more with your Twitch chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The chat can play using commands that are specified in the lobby of each mini game, while the streamer executes the game and transmits it, showing to the chat with a little transmission delay, his situation within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589460/extras/ba668d69d71bff5a6ddae7f9d46fbddf.avif?t=1754692316\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mini-games, each of them with specific rules, rhythm and funny interactions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 very varied mini-games (soon a new game) for you to play with your stream chat (we're always adding new games)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fun design of characters, locations and environments.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items, in case you need more action and frenzy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Divi\u00e9rtete con tu comunidad de twitch!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Little Fighters on Stream is a game designed for interaction and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The minigames that we have finished are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Struggle</strong>: Is a wrestling game where players will fight a battle with the other participants. (Viewers vs Viewers)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Where it Gone?</strong>: Will test your memory and speed to remember tiles. (All vs All)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Juegardo</strong>: It is a competition where participants must throw the hoop. (Viewers vs IA)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explosive Paint</strong>: The streamer draws a secret word and the chat must guess it or everything will explode. (Viewers vs Streamer)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape: The Killer Swuid</strong>: The chat must reach the goal, however if you move in the red light, you will die. (Viewers vs IA)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Boats</strong>: The boat with the most people will be eliminated. (Viewers vs Viewers )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Penalties</strong>: Chat throw the ball and the streamer must catch it, FOOTBALL! (Viewers vs Streamer)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lucky Weel</strong>: It's a simple roulette to generate a winner. (Viewers vs IA)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crazy Cars</strong>: A crazy car race full of obstacles and curves in which the vehicles must reach the finish line.\u00a0(Viewers vs IA) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589460/extras/3456e98d6ab9685cc8592b9c47116c35.avif?t=1754692316\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/Delay.png</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589460/extras/a212e537d92e03f215b235ac298e8226.avif?t=1754692316\" /></div>All mini games are designed with transmission delay in mind. This won't be a problem because all the mini games have a comfortable response time. Try it and you'll see it.</p>",
